二子，其後皆有天下：其一曰玄囂，是爲青陽，青陽降居江水；其二曰昌意，降居若水。昌意娶蜀山氏女，曰昌僕，生高陽，高陽有聖惪焉。黃帝崩，葬橋山。其孫昌意之子高陽立，是爲帝顓頊也。","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m005-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"黃帝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000001","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m005-0011","start":11,"end":15,"surface":"西陵之女","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000009","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m005-0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"嫘祖","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000009","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m005-0021","start":21,"end":23,"surface":"嫘祖","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000009","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m005-0024","start":24,"end":26,"surface":"黃帝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000001","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m005-0043","start":43,"end":45,"surface":"玄囂","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000010","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m005-0048","start":48,"end":50,"surface":"青陽","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000010","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m005-0051","start":51,"end":53,"surface":"青陽","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000010","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m005-0061","start":61,"end":63,"surface":"昌意","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000011","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m005-0069","start":69,"end":71,"surface":"昌意","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000011","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m005-0072","start":72,"end":76,"surface":"蜀山氏女","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000012","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m005-0078","start":78,"end":80,"surface":"昌僕","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000012","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m005-0082","start":82,"end":84,"surface":"高陽","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000013","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m005-0085","start":85,"end"